    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50569" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vermĭnātĭo</span></b> ,
			ōnis, f.
		vermino, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the worms</i>, a disease of animals, <i>the bots.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 28,
